WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:06.690
And now for the last question of the Bungee Time Quiz!

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.300
This will be a buzzer question with a video!

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.030
Once you get the answer, press the buzzer in your hand!

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.500
However, please be careful!

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.740
If you press too soon or get it wrong,
you'll fall straight into the abyss!

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.900
Alright, let's get going!

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.290
Start the video!

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:24.460
In order to save their kidnapped friend...

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.200
Heppokomaru!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.500
Heppokomaru, our heroes came to...

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.240
Cyber City!

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:34.380
And the next guy too!

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.470
Why me?

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:37.010
Cyber City.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:41.680
It was there that they fought the first of the Six Cyber Knights, Pana.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.100
Six Cyber Knights

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.100
Pana

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.350
White Tiger Twirl

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.190
While Bo-bobo and company had a hard time against him...

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.190
360 Degree Cyclone!!

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:55.610
they finally defeated Pana!

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.610
Nose Hair Spider Hold!!!

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:57.630
Lord Giga...

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.530
And now, here's the question!

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.410
Question:
How do you read this upside-down?
"Bobo-bo Bo-bobobo"

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:03.110
How do you read this upside-down?

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:06.130
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo!

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:09.240
Correct! And Beauty wins!

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:10.000
Oh, yeah!

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.160
And now for your prize, Beauty...

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:17.090
I present to you this strawberry soft-serve ice cream!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:17.930
Torpedo!

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:20.750
That prize is mine!

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:24.480
It's time for Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo!

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:30.110
Idiot Survivor!

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:32.150
Stay alive!

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:33.820
Idiot Survivor!

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:34.650
Baby!

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.570
Idiot Survivor!

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.530
Stay in the fight!

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.160
Idiot Survivor!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.080
Baby!

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.950
Whose fault is it,

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:46.540
That you're being so pathetic?

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.870
That's why I keep telling you,

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Hey, are you trying to put up with me or something?

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:50.750
Ain't that right?

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.420
Come on, I know you've looked happier than this before,

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:53.590
Like that time you went to buy clothes.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:54.340
Yeah, you know what I mean!

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.090
Hey, you see that old guy's face over there?

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.630
That's gonna be you one day!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.600
So, let's go out there and survive!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:46.520
SweetDevilStitch

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.400
This is a FREE fansub
Not For Sale, Rent, or Auction!

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:15.000
That guy cracks me up!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.210
I know, right!? He's so lame!

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:21.470
Impossible... My Fist of the Carrot's been defeated?

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:23.390
Well then...

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.720
I think it's time to make some creative art!

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:29.350
There we go.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:31.600
It's a doll of me!

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.640
What the hell is going on?

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:45.570
Invitation to

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:45.570
the Abyss!?

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.570
Aerial
Showdown!

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.570
Bungee Battle

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:45.570
Begins!!

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:56.420
Well, that was a flop. Five points.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.760
Meanwhile, Bo-bobo and company

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.050
had just defeated one of the Six Cyber Knights, Pana...

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:04.810
in exchange for Tennosuke's life.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.140
In exchange for
Tennosuke's life

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.140
No! Still alive over here!

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:13.080
So Heppokomaru isn't here...

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:14.790
Why, you little...

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.700
Don't get so cocky just because you beat Pana.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.200
Those giant monitors just appeared in the sky!

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.790
And one of them's a completely ridiculous-looking monitor!

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.120
Who are you?

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:38.380
We are the Six Cyber Knights.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:42.460
Six Cyber Knights

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:42.980
How convenient that you who disturbed our Hair Hunt turned out to be Fist Users.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:47.670
Now we're going to hunt your Fists, felons!

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:48.930
This doesn't sound good, Bo-bobo!

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.080
Who's a good boy?

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.270
They're not even listening!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:56.460
These monitors are connected to our Hair Hunt Stadiums.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.610
Now choose your final resting place!

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.510
You're cruel!

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:01.830
I say bring it on!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.280
Yakkun got a hole in one into the fly!

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.270
You bastards! Here we come!

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:11.550
Yeah!

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:14.640
But before all that, let's share some natto!

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.420
As a sign of our new friendship!

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.000
They're opening with natto!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.040
We have you now!

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:24.510
Allow me to hunt you!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.470
We're being drawn in!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.760
Y-You guys!

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:36.350
Now, get over here!

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.430
I wanna read rom-coms!

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.420
That's a really ugly robot!

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:42.010
We made it.

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:44.360
They came out of its cheek!
That's one messed-up robot!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:48.030
What kind of place is this? There's a cave below us!

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:54.420
We're being pulled down!

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.960
It's a bungee cord!

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.360
Welcome to the Bungee Hair Hunt Stadium!

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.590
Who's there?

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:10.370
I am one of the Six Cyber Knights, Sonic.

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:11.140
Six Cyber Knights
Sonic

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:14.810
His blood's all gone to his head! In fact, his face is all red!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.140
The pain...

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.730
I can't... go on...

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.270
I wanna go home...

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:25.150
Preemptive Strike!

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.360
Bottles

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.870
How dare you raise your hand against me!

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.960
You'll have to answer to my two lackeys now!

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.290
Your two lackeys?

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:40.870
Allow me to introduce you!

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.840
First up we have...

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.830
Super Rabbit!

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:49.430
He's not living up to his name!

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:53.050
And he even spelled "super" wrong!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.630
And my second lackey is...

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:57.370
Despair Kid!

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:59.430
I don't care if I fall.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:03.320
What's wrong with you?
You can't fall! Have some more hope!

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:04.900
There's nothing good about him!

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:08.530
Whatever the case, these guys are dangerous in a totally different sense of the word!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:18.260
Now listen... It's a three-on-four bungee battle!

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:21.580
And there's nothing but the abyss below us.
Once you fall, it's all over.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.960
Let's do this then!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.250
I'll give you a taste of my chain scythe!

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:31.720
He's falling with a really sad face!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.550
Don Patch!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.760
Catch!

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:37.810
And now I move right into...

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:44.060
That's all I need you for.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:50.190
Now you've done it! But I can use the cord's recoil...

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:51.780
He sprouted wings!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.950
Take this! Killer Rocket Attack!

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.590
I missed!

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:07.790
You missed by a country mile!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.670
That was close shave!

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.840
Alright! Let's kick his ass as he falls!

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:16.680
Back me up here, lackeys!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:19.260
They're totally demotivated!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:20.600
Dammit!

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.540
Now, Tennosuke!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:24.190
OK!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.780
Fist of the Wobble-Wobble Secret Technique:
Wrecking Ball Bullet!!!!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:30.790
He did it!

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.070
Nice one!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:33.340
Dammit...

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:34.630
Wing Cutter!

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.820
I'm gonna fall!

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.410
It's not cut through! I'm hanging on by a thread!

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:42.600
Now <i>that</i> was close.

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:50.330
But now there's a pair of naughty swallows pecking at it!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:52.420
Tennie's in trouble again!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:56.510
Please stop it, swallows! That string is not edible!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.630
Stop it!

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:04.940
They bit down hard on it!

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:07.300
Oh no! I'm falling!

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.950
Of course! I must rely on the Nu for help!

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:14.630
Oh, Nu handkerchief... Become a magic carpet and save my life!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:17.450
Become a magic carpet and save my life!

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:19.160
That's not gonna happen!

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:20.240
Nu handkerchief!

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.990
Tennosuke!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.160
Well, that's one down!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.500
How dare you kill our friend Tennosuke!

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:33.210
But I'll tell you what, you won't be able to cut our strings so easily!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.050
What?

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:38.290
Because I just switched my rope...

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:40.390
With spaghetti with meat sauce!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.390
This

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.030
What the...

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.900
Now it's down to just the two of you!

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.550
So, what's your next move?

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.190
Now it's down to just the two of you!

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:20.290
You're no match for the three of us!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.010
But one of you already fell!

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:29.560
Who cares if I fall...?

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:34.610
Die! Long-distance Wing Cutter!

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:36.130
Watch out!

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.450
I missed!

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:42.990
Now it's my turn!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.840
Take this! Bo-bobo Cutter!

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.080
Bo-bobo Cutter? I threw that piece of junk out.

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:55.840
Okay...

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.830
Then you go instead!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.010
Now you're messing with me!

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:07.230
I'll show you the true terror of the Six Cyber Knights!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.840
Change!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.150
Change complete!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:18.150
Cyber Cross Jet Form!!!

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:21.510
His armor turned into a rocket!

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:23.280
Alright! I'll transform, too!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.950
You can do that?

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.310
Transformation complete!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.500
He transformed into a nugget!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:31.940
Look out!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.630
Cyber Jet 100mph Slicing Fist!!!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:41.720
Bo-bobo!

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:45.930
That shock sent Bo-bobo flying towards Super Rabbit!

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.820
Super Rabbit's showing off some amazing moves!

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:06.160
Oh! Superb, Super Rabbit!

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:09.400
Bo-bobo!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:14.170
Help Me Mask

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:10.800
Yes?

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:12.050
He's undamaged!

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:14.170
He's even reading manga!

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:18.500
But you can't move in that position!

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:25.640
It's time to taste the terror of the Bungee Hair Hunt Stadium!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.270
Fist of the Nose Hair Secret Technique:

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:33.940
Take this!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.630
Bagworm Defense!!

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:36.270
What?!

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:36.860
Followed by...

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:39.190
Laser?

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:41.030
How strange.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.860
Where could they have gotten to?

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:45.530
Amazing! They're overwhelming Sonic!

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:46.980
They're incredible!

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:50.700
Well, I can't see them around here.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:54.500
You rotten bastard!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.960
Bo-bobo! What about Don Patch?

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.830
I suppose it's time to call them back.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:05.230
Wait, you can do that?

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:06.800
Fist of the Nose Hair Secret Technique:

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:11.550
Snacktime!

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:13.400
Okay, everybody gather around!

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:16.060
Yeah, no way! This won't bring them back!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.660
Snacks!

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:25.450
They're back! And they're swimming upwards!?

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:27.740
Snacks!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.040
Even that weird guy is joining their snacktime!

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:42.850
Um... Didn't you fall down just a minute ago?

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:51.160
I just...

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.180
I just want snacks! Is that too much to ask?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.730
What are you guys doing?

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:02.880
Snacks!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:03.570
Snacks!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.610
Come on! Fight me like men!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:10.970
OK, snack time's over!

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:12.940
Man, I'm full!

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:14.700
Huh? But I want more!

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:20.000
He fell again! Was it that much of a shock?

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:22.950
That aside, these cookies look pretty expensive!

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:24.380
I'd say about 20,000 yen each!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:27.750
I guess I did splurge a bit...
But I had just enough money...

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:29.090
in Tennosuke's wallet.

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.840
My life savings!

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:35.890
He's falling like an autumn leaf!

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:39.440
Sonic! Our pointless battle ends now!

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:43.300
I'll show you the essence of the Fist of the Nose Hair!

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:44.440
Just what I wanted to hear!

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:45.900
Here goes!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.070
Fist of the Nose Hair Secret Technique:
You get a red card!!

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:54.120
Red Card? And what's with those annoying motions?

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:02.420
A weird box just appeared out of thin air!

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.760
What's that box for?

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:13.910
Not even I know what will happen to those who enter the Mystery Box.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:15.950
You'll just have to find out for yourselves!

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.990
That's a pretty reckless secret technique!

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.810
Winner

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.810
Also, that's not even a red card!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.630
Tennosuke fell inside!

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:27.440
There was boiling-hot ramen inside!

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:29.680
That ramen was so hot, he's on fire!

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:31.240
Damn. He came back.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.930
I get it!

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:36.200
Now that the box is there,
at least we can't fall to the abyss!

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.040
We won't lose Despair Kid now!

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:42.870
He managed to avoid it!

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.460
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.190
If there aren't any cookies, I may as well fall.

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:50.550
Are cookies all you're living for?

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.890
Cookies? Hang on, I think there are a few left...

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:58.620
Cookies!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:01.180
He's coming back! On a surfboard, too!

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:03.350
Oh wait... those aren't cookies...

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.570
Just dengaku!

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:06.170
Eat dengaku, nah-la!

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:06.990
No thanks.

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.070
What was that, nah-la?

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:12.070
He fell in the box this time! What's gonna happen?

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.770
Dreams do come true! Life is beautiful!

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:18.350
Life is beautiful!

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:20.410
He's overflowing with hope!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:23.120
That's one dangerous box!

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:25.670
Anything really can happen!

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:29.130
That's even more reason not to fall...

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.970
It's a wonderful life!

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:33.800
After this break,

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.350
Is the super-fun

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:37.350
Bo-boroscope!

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:40.470
Everyone, get ready for Rock Paper Scissors!

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.310
Alright, here we go!

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:43.650
Rock,

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:44.530
paper,

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:45.270
scissors!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.580
Remember whether you won or lost.

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:51.990
Your fortune will be revealed
at the end of the show!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:56.320
What kind of box is this?
Anything really can happen!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:58.530
This is dangerous! We can't afford any risks!

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:01.410
This is even more reason not to fall...

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:07.540
<i>But then again, the same goes for them! This battle is going to be good!</i>

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:15.550
Is it just me, or are there are angels floating around us all of a sudden?

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:18.970
What's going on? What are you trying to do?

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.220
First we trick you with a pretty face, then...

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:24.900
What's going on?

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:25.640
It's a hornet's nest!

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:28.190
But our innocent smiles make you forgive us!

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:38.520
It's just a playful prank by us naughty angels!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.580
That's way more than just naughty!

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.640
I'm falling!

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:45.660
And the box is below me! What's going to happen now?

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:50.960
Now it's time for you to taste my bungee karate!

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.670
Survival of the Fittest!!

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:59.720
This is a grim reminder of the harshness of Mother Nature!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.600
Damn those punks!

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:09.260
Bring it on, assholes!!!

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:10.520
He's more bullish than he's acting!

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:14.320
I have you now! Rocket Attack!

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:21.160
Try and come up here if you can!

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:24.650
Alright, how's this?

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:25.410
What?

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.870
Here we go!

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:32.350
Jump out!

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:35.340
Wow, that's annoying! And where's that splash coming from?

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:37.220
Here they come!

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:40.580
Now fall into the box!

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:51.590
Why, you...

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:00.150
This one's for those two guys!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:03.620
Dammit!

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:07.600
They both fell in the box!

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.010
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:15.380
He's turned into a ridiculous shape!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.410
Spike Roller of Hell!!!

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.100
He's already mastered a new move!

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:29.890
Super Rabbit!

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:34.980
Oh, yeah! Tennosuke also fell in with Don Patch! What happened to him?

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:40.270
There he is!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.030
Ne

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:47.240
He's fighting some kind of weird battle!

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:50.830
That's scary! That box is seriously scary!

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:56.960
But I still have my lackeys!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.610
Go, Super Rabbit!

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:01.920
He's gone back to tame right when he needed him most!

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.610
I don't have any decent lackeys!

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.600
You finally noticed? A little slow on the uptake there!

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:09.140
Shut up!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.900
Beauty!

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:16.800
Beauty...

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:21.570
He's...

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.550
You're...

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.980
Don't throw your life away!

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:37.920
Speak for yourself!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.210
It's the Spike Roller of Hell again!

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:45.760
Are you alright, Beauty?

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:46.800
I dunno, are you?

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:50.850
How dare you harm Beauty!
Now tastee my special bungee attack!

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:53.180
What? Your special bungee attack?

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:55.190
Here goes!

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:56.600
Here he comes!

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:01.760
That's got nothing to do with bungee!

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:03.280
In fact, it's probably the furthest you can get!

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:08.780
Can't let you do that!

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:11.020
Bo-bobo! Let's use that technique!

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:16.190
Secret Technique:
20-Ton Press of Hell!!

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:19.290
This kind of brutality would put the devil to shame!

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:25.930
Tennosuke!

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.190
They're all yours!

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:30.440
This is one strong Ne!

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:32.700
Tennosuke!

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:34.980
I've got my hands full over here!

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:38.190
I can at least take him down with me...

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:39.730
You leave me no choice!

00:21:42.810 --> 00:21:44.190
Nu!

00:21:48.190 --> 00:21:52.580
<i>Amubosatsu meiekiteikai
kuushokuzeshoku shikijinhoren!</i>

00:21:56.650 --> 00:22:01.290
What the hell? Tennosuke's playing a bigger part than ever before!

00:22:05.180 --> 00:22:07.590
<i>Onkutenmitsu harakaisha...</i>

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:14.770
He sealed them away!

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:19.310
We did it!

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:23.670
Now the Six Cyber Knights are down to four.

00:22:24.210 --> 00:22:24.650
Bang!

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:29.320
They're so strong! They've even defeated Sonic!

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:34.410
I don't believe it! They defeated two of the invincible Six Cyber Knights!

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.370
Way to go!

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:39.010
Meanwhile, elsewhere...

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:42.120
Hey you! Keep walking!

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:44.130
Damn you...

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:48.100
Seriously?

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:49.680
Yeah, totally!

00:22:50.020 --> 00:22:51.790
Here we are.

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:53.640
Where are we?

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:57.890
Who are you?

00:22:59.800 --> 00:23:02.400
Heppokomaru has been brought before Giga!

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:05.130
