Everyone who wants to shout come on over!!

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:56.160
We'll all burst out laughing! Burst out running!

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:02.670
Everyone who wants to make a riot come on over!!

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.130
We'll all burst out laughing! Burst out running!

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:10.590
Everyone who wants to shout come on over!!

00:24:10.590 --> 00:24:12.180
We'll all burst out laughing! Burst out running!

00:24:16.930 --> 00:24:18.640
Everyone who wants to make a riot come on over!!

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:20.180
We'll all burst out laughing! Burst out running!

