00:24:57.550 --> 00:25:00.130
Bo-bobo's nose hairs have been cursed and they've disappeared!

00:25:00.130 --> 00:25:01.970
What should I do? Now I can't get married!

00:25:01.970 --> 00:25:02.950
Right, right.

00:25:02.950 --> 00:25:06.120
More importantly, somehow we've been surrounded by demons!

00:25:06.120 --> 00:25:07.520
Don't worry, Beauty.

00:25:07.520 --> 00:25:10.110
